     "website": "https://www.soitec.com",
     "description": "Soitec S.A. is a global leader specializing in the design and production of advanced semiconductor materials. These sophisticated materials form the foundational components for microchips utilized across an expansive spectrum of electronic devices. This includes ubiquitous consumer electronics like smartphones, tablets, and personal computers, alongside crucial infrastructure such as IT servers and data centers. Their applications extend further into automotive electronics, connected devices (IoT), and specialized industrial and medical instrumentation. The company's extensive portfolio features a variety of specialized solutions. For instance, its Fully Depleted Silicon-On-Insulator (FD-SOI) technology supports applications like automotive radar and processors, while PD-SOI and FinFET-SOI products cater to the demands of high-performance computing markets. RF-SOI substrates are essential for front-end module devices in both 4G LTE and the latest 5G (sub-6 GHz/mmWave) smartphone technologies. Power-SOI offerings enable the integration of high and low voltage functions within power IC devices, serving the automotive and industrial sectors. Other innovative products comprise Smart Photonics-SOI for optical networking solutions, Smart Imager-SOI for cutting-edge 3D image sensing, and Auto Smartsic, contributing to greener mobility initiatives. Soitec also provides Connect RF-GaN for 5G infrastructure architecture and smartphone power amplifiers, Connect-POI engineered substrates vital for high-performance surface acoustic wave (SAW) filters, and Gallium Nitride (GaN) Epitaxial wafers crucial for energy-efficient power management systems. Established in 1992, Soitec S.A. maintains its corporate headquarters in Bernin, France.",
